  {
   "id": "kiborg-arena-306565@patch-2024-09-13",
   "gameId": "kiborg-arena-306565",
   "displayName": "Mega Patch!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-13T18:06:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everybody! We want to share with you our biggest update as of yet, which contains three major additions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) You can now beat the game! Completing the 30th round will mean that you've completed the main part of the game. All these rounds were also rebalanced. You can still continue to play endlessly after the 30th round with fights getting progressively more difficult each round.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) The Trophy Room! Here you can behold every weapon or implant that you've used during your runs. It can be accessed from the hub.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Hats! For every round starting with the 5th you will get a unique hat which you can wear on your next runs. So a total of 26 hats!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "And as usual we've made several smaller changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Additional info on the melee weapon selection screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made camera movement a little bit smoother.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Further optimized the game (HUD and arena fences).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Steam Deck version now uses Vulkan which results in better performance, please notify us if you encounter any problems.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the game sometimes freezing on the reward screen when not starting from the first round.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an auto-pause for when the Steam overlay is opened.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a stagger resist bonus for enemies chasing the player.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed camera shaking from the Blur's ghost attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the player looking into the camera when aiming.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "When anti-aliasing is set to non-TSR virtual shadows are now replaced with regular shadows in order to reduce the noise.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Russian localization for the achievements and made some fixes to the English version.: Remember to wishlist and follow the main game so you don't miss anything! And don't hesitate to send us any feedback you have - we read everything you write and always try to fix the bugs that you've found!: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2405060",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
