      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the red rewards being reset after exiting the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed one of the machine guns that was fully replenishing its ammo after a single strike.: We're also actively working on the future updates where we will try to fix the problems that you write us about the most: weak AIs, boring upgrade tree, etc.",
